  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/poem-jizengxiaofan-intro.mp3",
    "text": "酥酥，我们一起读一读刘禹锡的《寄赠小樊》吧！",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/poem-jizengxiaofan-line-1.mp3",
    "text": "花面丫头十三四",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/poem-jizengxiaofan-line-2.mp3",
    "text": "春来绰约向人时",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/poem-jizengxiaofan-line-3.mp3",
    "text": "终须买取名春草",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/poem-jizengxiaofan-line-4.mp3",
    "text": "处处将行步步随",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-reminders-intro.mp3",
    "text": "酥酥，我们一起读《弟子规》，学着关心家人、温和地说话。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-line-1.mp3",
    "text": "亲爱我，孝何难？亲憎我，孝方贤。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-line-2.mp3",
    "text": "亲有过，谏使更，怡吾色，柔吾声。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-question.mp3",
    "text": "爸爸忘了关水龙头，你可以怎么提醒他？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  },
  {
    "path": "/chinese/assets/audio/dizigui-gentle-answer.mp3",
    "text": "用温和的声音提醒：爸爸，水龙头还开着，我们一起关好吧。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoshuangNeural"
  }
]
